{
  "Scenes.Isabella.DrankMalkYaCunt.SucklesMilk": "Isabella pulls one of her breasts out of her low-cut shirt and begins to suckle at one of the many-tipped nipples. Her cheeks fill and hollow a few times while you watch with spellbound intensity. She finishes and tucks the weighty orb away, blushing furiously. The quick drink seems to have reinvigorated her, and watching it has definitely aroused you."
  "Scenes.Isabella.IsabellaAttack.BlankLine": "\n"
  "Scenes.Isabella.IsabellaAttack.CatchesCharge": "You brace yourself and catch her shield in both hands, dragging through the dirt as you slow her charge to a stop. She gapes down, completely awestruck by the show of power."
  "Scenes.Isabella.IsabellaAttack.ShieldCharge": "Isabella snorts and lowers a shield a moment before she begins to charge towards you. Her hooves tear huge divots out of the ground as she closes the distance with surprising speed! "
  "Scenes.Isabella.IsabellaAttack.ShieldHitsHard": "She's coming too fast to dodge, and you're forced to try to stop her. It doesn't work. Isabella's shield hits you hard enough to ring your ears and knock you onto your back with bruising force."
  "Scenes.Isabella.IsabellaStun.BackhandDeflected": "You deflect her blow away, taking no damage.\n"
  "Scenes.Isabella.IsabellaStun.BackhandSpins": "Isabella spins her shield back at you in a potent, steel-assisted backhand. "
  "Scenes.Isabella.IsabellaStun.BackhandStaggers": "You try to avoid it, but her steely attack connects, rocking you back. You stagger about while trying to get your bearings, but it's all you can do to stay on your feet. <b>Isabella has stunned you!</b>"
  "Scenes.Isabella.IsabellaStun.BlankLine": "\n"
  "Scenes.Isabella.IsabellaThroatPunch.BlankLine": "\n"
  "Scenes.Isabella.IsabellaThroatPunch.FistsBlock": "You manage to block her with your own fists.\n"
  "Scenes.Isabella.IsabellaThroatPunch.ResoluteIgnore": "You resolutely ignore the blow thanks to your immense toughness.\n"
  "Scenes.Isabella.IsabellaThroatPunch.ThroatPunch": "Isabella punches out from behind her shield in a punch aimed right at your throat! "
  "Scenes.Isabella.IsabellaThroatPunch.WindpipeCollapse": "You try your best to stop the onrushing fist, but it hits you square in the throat, nearly collapsing your windpipe entirely. Gasping and sputtering, you try to breathe, and while it's difficult, you manage enough to prevent suffocation. <b>It will be impossible to focus to cast a spell in this state!</b>"
  "Scenes.Isabella.React.ArrowThunksShield": "You arrow thunks into Isabella's shield, completely blocked by the wall of steel.[pg-]"
  "Scenes.Isabella.React.BlindCryAccent": "[say: Nein! I cannot see!] cries Isabella.[pg-]"
  "Scenes.Isabella.React.BlindCryPlain": "[say: No! I cannot see!] cries Isabella.[pg-]"
  "Scenes.Isabella.React.HorsePeopleCheerAccent": "[say: You remind me of ze horse-people. They cannot deal vith mein shield either!] cheers Isabella.[pg-]"
  "Scenes.Isabella.React.HorsePeopleCheerPlain": "[say: You remind me of the horse-people. They cannot deal with my shield either!] cheers Isabella.[pg-]"
  "Scenes.Isabella.React.ShieldBlocksShot": "Isabella hears the shot and turns her shield towards it, completely blocking it with her wall of steel.[pg-]"
  "Scenes.Isabella.Won.TutsIckLeaves": "[pg][say: Ick,] Isabella tuts as she turns to leave..."
}
